guide polestar-completionist-horde/dungeon-scholomance
title Scholomance (Completionist)
faction Horde
category Dungeons
levels 58-60
zone Western Plaguelands
next polestar-completionist-horde/50-swamp-of-sorrows-2
pitch Scholomance, in Western Plaguelands.
why Every Horde quest of Scholomance: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

